title: "Skip-pattern side channels of content-aware camera gating: code, preregistration, derived data and measured traces"
abstract: >-
  Gate families, observers, mutual-information estimators, attacks, bound checks, real-plug validation
  (ESP32-S3 replay firmware and INA219 traces) and every result table behind a study of event leakage
  through the open schedules of content-aware camera gates.
